msgstr "分侧 TCP 偏移"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:159
#: 2c220093e89447a98650e8aaf2bb922b
msgid ""
"Profile `defaults.ft.type`: `none` \\| `kwr75_485` \\| `kwr75_usb` (or "
"left / right). `end_effectors` / `ft` / `tcp_offset` all accept a "
"symmetric key that expands to both sides; a missing side falls back to "
"the symmetric value."
msgstr ""
"Profile 的 `defaults.ft.type`：`none` | `kwr75_485` | `kwr75_usb`（或 left / "
"right）。`end_effectors` / `ft` / `tcp_offset` 都支持对称键并展开到左右；缺侧回退对称值。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:161
#: 666303fc20d54d358d1ed22b0c848451
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"TCP strings are evaluated **before** xacro (`${PI/2}`, `pi/2`, "
"`radians(90)`, numbers). Failed evaluation errors; they are not written "
"silently. Virtual tip also needs `left_ee_frame` / `right_ee_frame` in "
"`control.patch` (or controller params), e.g. `left_tcp_offset`."
msgstr ""
"TCP 字符串在写入 xacro "
"**之前**求值（`${PI/2}`、`pi/2`、`radians(90)`、纯数字）。求值失败会报错，不会静默写入。选用虚拟 tip "
"时，还需在 `control.patch`（或控制器参数）中设置 `left_ee_frame` / `right_ee_frame`（例如 "
"`left_tcp_offset`）。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/descriptions/2-common.md:163
#: f8af76e8fc194684b59efd50a44d864b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> \\"
"\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  ft:=kwr75_485 \\\n"
"  tcp_offset_rpy:=\"0 0 ${PI/2}\""
msgstr ""
"ros2 launch robot_common_launch humanoid.launch.py robot:=<robot_name> \\"
"\n"
"  robot_profile:=/path/to/machine_profile.yaml \\\n"
"  ft:=kwr75_485 \\\n"
"  tcp_offset_rpy:=\"0 0 ${PI/2}\""

